Note on scope: this license covers the plugin's own source. The OpenCode tool
definitions the plugin sends at runtime (opencode_tools.json) are a separate
work, fetched by the user rather than distributed here — see README_CN.md,
"工具定义数据". They originate from OpenCode's CLI; the copy this plugin was
verified against came from opencode2api, which is GPL-3.0-or-later.
